    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061106.0044\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 6 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nShenzhen stock index up -- Nov. 6\n\n\n\n\nThe Component Stock Index on the Shenzhen Stock Exchange closed at 4,785.37 points on Monday, up 94.94 points from the previous close.\n\nA Share Index: 5,024.66 points, up 99.68 points;\n\nB Share Index: 2,817.62 points, up 61.12 points;\n\nTotal Turnover: 14,619,420,000 yuan.",
